        "answerKey": "1. Divergence: $\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{F} = \\frac{\\partial(xy^2)}{\\partial x} + \\frac{\\partial(y^3z)}{\\partial y} + \\frac{\\partial(z^2x)}{\\partial z} = y^2 + 3y^2z + 2zx$. At $(1,1,1)$: $\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{F} = 1 + 3 + 2 = 6 \\neq 0$. Not solenoidal.\n2. Curl: $\\nabla\\times\\mathbf{F} = \\begin{vmatrix}\\hat{i}&\\hat{j}&\\hat{k}\\\\ \\partial_x&\\partial_y&\\partial_z\\\\ xy^2&y^3z&z^2x\\end{vmatrix} = (0-y^3)\\hat{i} - (z^2 - 0)\\hat{j} + (0 - 2xy)\\hat{k} = -y^3\\hat{i} - z^2\\hat{j} - 2xy\\hat{k}$. At $(1,1,1)$: $\\nabla\\times\\mathbf{F} = -\\hat{i} - \\hat{j} - 2\\hat{k} \\neq \\mathbf{0}$. Not irrotational."
